    {
      "id": 13,
      "attributes": {
        "title": "Vision for Scajaquada Presentation | Oct 26, 2026",
        "slug": "vision-for-scajaquada-presentation-oct-26-2026",
        "startingAt": "2026-10-26T21:30:00.000Z",
        "endingAt": "2026-10-26T23:00:00.000Z",
        "content": "After years of planning to repair the damage caused by Rte 198, progress remains stalled, with a lengthy environmental review process still ahead.\n\nWhat if we started now?\nWe know that the Scajaquada Corridor shouldn\u2019t function as an expressway. What if simple, affordable changes could begin transforming it now? We have ideas to move the One Region Central vision forward. Let\u2019s Talk.\n\nRSVP encouraged here: [RSVP form](https://forms.gle/AMURoBgPxxHcbhpr9)\n![Restore the Vision Flyer](https://res.cloudinary.com/ihiutch/image/upload/v1792518240/1_533bbe4b28.jpg)",
        "createdAt": "2026-10-22T18:06:47.289Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-23T21:15:35.523Z",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:06:50.560Z",
